        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥚 EGGMART - Surprise Egg Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If luck favors you, you'll get rich!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world filled with mysterious surprise eggs! In EGGMART, you're not just running a store - you're playing big gambles. Every egg is a secret, every opening an adventure. What will be inside? An ordinary toy, or a legendary collectible that makes you rich?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Let The Game of Chance Begin!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy eggs wholesale, crack them open, see what you get! Each egg contains different toys and some are SUPER RARE. Found a legendary piece? Congratulations, you're about to make a fortune! But be careful - sometimes only common stuff comes out and you lose money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every opening is pure adrenaline! Your heart races as you wait for that moment, and when the result appears you either jump with joy or try again in disappointment. This is what addiction feels like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💎 Rarity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different rarities can drop from each egg:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong> - Standard profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare</strong> - Good money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic</strong> - Big score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary</strong> - JACKPOT! Time to make a fortune!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck, find rare pieces, sell them at outrageous prices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏪 Business Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your store, line up eggs on shelves, sell to customers. But the real deal is in your hands: Buy eggs wholesale, start cracking, evaluate what comes out. Profit or loss? No gain without risk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell the toys too!</strong> Put rare toys from eggs on shelves, let customers buy them. Both surprise eggs and toys mean money for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 Growth and Risk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money, buy more eggs, crack more open! Expand your store, attract more customers. Hire employees - let them work the register while you keep cracking eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>License system</strong> unlocks new egg types. Each license brings different toy collections and different rarity chances. Which eggs are more profitable? It's your job to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storage system</strong> for bulk stocking. Buy hundreds of eggs at once, start the cracking frenzy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Pricing Tactics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers don't buy everything! Price too high and customers complain and leave. Too low and you lose money. What price will you put on that legendary toy? That's where strategy comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirt drives customers away, complete missions to earn rewards, track your daily profit/loss with reports.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎰 Risk or Safety?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two paths: Either sell eggs unopened for guaranteed but low profit. Or crack them open, try your luck - maybe you win big, maybe you lose. How will you play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day a new chance, every egg a new hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGGMART</strong> - Crack to win... Or lose! 🎲</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥚 EGGMART - Surprise Egg Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If luck favors you, you'll get rich!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world filled with mysterious surprise eggs! In EGGMART, you're not just running a store - you're playing big gambles. Every egg is a secret, every opening an adventure. What will be inside? An ordinary toy, or a legendary collectible that makes you rich?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Let The Game of Chance Begin!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy eggs wholesale, crack them open, see what you get! Each egg contains different toys and some are SUPER RARE. Found a legendary piece? Congratulations, you're about to make a fortune! But be careful - sometimes only common stuff comes out and you lose money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every opening is pure adrenaline! Your heart races as you wait for that moment, and when the result appears you either jump with joy or try again in disappointment. This is what addiction feels like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💎 Rarity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different rarities can drop from each egg:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong> - Standard profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare</strong> - Good money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic</strong> - Big score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary</strong> - JACKPOT! Time to make a fortune!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck, find rare pieces, sell them at outrageous prices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏪 Business Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your store, line up eggs on shelves, sell to customers. But the real deal is in your hands: Buy eggs wholesale, start cracking, evaluate what comes out. Profit or loss? No gain without risk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell the toys too!</strong> Put rare toys from eggs on shelves, let customers buy them. Both surprise eggs and toys mean money for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 Growth and Risk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money, buy more eggs, crack more open! Expand your store, attract more customers. Hire employees - let them work the register while you keep cracking eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>License system</strong> unlocks new egg types. Each license brings different toy collections and different rarity chances. Which eggs are more profitable? It's your job to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storage system</strong> for bulk stocking. Buy hundreds of eggs at once, start the cracking frenzy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Pricing Tactics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers don't buy everything! Price too high and customers complain and leave. Too low and you lose money. What price will you put on that legendary toy? That's where strategy comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirt drives customers away, complete missions to earn rewards, track your daily profit/loss with reports.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎰 Risk or Safety?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two paths: Either sell eggs unopened for guaranteed but low profit. Or crack them open, try your luck - maybe you win big, maybe you lose. How will you play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day a new chance, every egg a new hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGGMART</strong> - Crack to win... Or lose! 🎲</p>",
        "short_description": "Crack open surprise eggs and discover what's inside! Find rare toys to get rich or lose it all. Every opening is a gamble, every egg a chance. Build your store, sell eggs or crack them open - no risk, no reward. If luck's on your side, fortune awaits!",
